# The captured test-user storageState is a live credential (Slack `d`/`d-s`
# session cookies). It is materialized at runtime from the ESO-synced K8s
# Secret by gardenio/tests/e2e/scripts/test-slack-ui.sh into a private temp
# file and handed in via SLACK_E2E_STORAGE_STATE. It must NEVER be committed —
# this glob is a belt-and-suspenders guard against an accidental local capture.
storage-state.json
*storage-state*.json
